      "content": "ok, i see what you mean about 11,000,999. but looking at it again, that patent seems more about general interconnects rather than specifically targeting input sparsity like we are. do you think they'll actually try to claim our approach, or is it distinct enough that we can push through without much trouble? i'm just worried about the legal budget if we're walking into a fight we can't win.",
